---
// biome-ignore-all assist/source/organizeImports: Astro component imports stay grouped for readability.
// biome-ignore-all lint/correctness/noUnusedImports: Astro frontmatter imports are referenced in the template.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import { getSiteUrl } from '../lib/site';

const { absoluteUrl } = getSiteUrl(Astro);
const description = "Terms of Service for Maho Browser and Mail. Free tier, Pro $5/mo, Max $20/mo subscriptions, PAYG credits, and BYOK usage terms.";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — Maho" description={description}>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground">
    <Nav />
    <main id="main" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-24">
      <h1 class="heading-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mb-12">Effective: June 28, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        By downloading or using Maho applications, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, you may not use our software.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">License</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Maho grants you a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the software for personal or commercial use. This license does not grant you any rights to modify, distribute, or create derivative works unless explicitly permitted in writing by the Developer, or under a separate open-source license accompanying a specific component released as such.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The software is provided as-is. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any aspect of the software at any time without notice.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Software License</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Maho Browser and Maho Mail are proprietary software, developed and provided by an individual developer (hereinafter "the Developer"). The software is licensed, not sold, under the terms of this agreement. Source code is not publicly distributed. The Developer may, at sole discretion, release individual components as open source under separate license terms; such components are governed by their respective licenses.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">User Data</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Maho applications run locally on your device. We do not collect, store, or transmit your personal data, emails, browsing history, or any other information to our servers. All data remains under your control on your device.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Maho applications connect to email providers, local sync servers, and AI model backends. These connections are made directly from your device, or through our billing proxy for managed subscriptions. We are not responsible for the availability, terms, or policies of third-party model providers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Pricing and Billing</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Maho offers three recurring monthly subscription tiers: Free at $0/mo, Pro at $5/mo, and Max at $20/mo. Subscriptions renew automatically each month unless you cancel before the renewal date. Billing is processed through LemonSqueezy, our Merchant of Record.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Pay-as-you-go credits are sold as one-time purchases in $10, $50, and $100 packs. Credits never expire in your account. Credit purchases are non-refundable after 14 days from the purchase date. Refunds requested within 14 days are capped at the unconsumed balance.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Bring your own key (BYOK) is free and does not create any Maho billing. If you use BYOK, you are responsible for the terms, pricing, and account standing with your API provider.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Frontier models are excluded from Maho-managed tiers and are available through BYOK only. Maho does not bill you for BYOK usage. Your provider bills that usage directly under its own pricing.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        You can cancel subscriptions at any time. Paid access continues until the end of the current paid period, and then the subscription does not renew.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Acceptable Use & Abuse Prevention</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        You agree not to use Maho-managed AI services for any unlawful activities, generation of prohibited content, or automated bulk spamming. We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that exhibit abusive usage patterns, exceed their tier-specific per-request limits, or attempt to bypass billing and authentication mechanisms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The software is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to the implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that the software will be error-free or uninterrupted.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        In no event shall the Developer, contributors, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or relating to your use of the software, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the software after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms. We encourage you to review these terms periodically.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mt-10 mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Questions about these terms can be directed to hello@maho.app
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Terms of Service — Maho",
    "description": description,
    "url": absoluteUrl('/terms'),
    "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "@id": "https://maho.app/#website" },
  })} />
</BaseLayout>
